        "jsCode": "\n// The seven rows that received a real email during the incident.\n// They currently have deal_shared=\"No\" + fu1_done=\"Yes\" (inconsistent state from the FU1 misroute).\n// Setting deal_shared=\"Yes\" makes them continue at FU2 on their next_due (2026-09-05) instead of re-INITIALing.\nconst ids = ['D00001','D00002','D00003','D00004','D00005','D00006','D00007'];\nreturn ids.map(id => ({ json: { deal_id: id, deal_shared: 'Yes' } }));\n"
